{"id":"n26872-1-10","stage":0,"title":"실례 · 失礼","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26872-1-10-1","ko":"실례지만 혹시 지금 몇 시입니까?","zh":"打扰一下，请问现在几点？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"실례지만","meaning":"冒昧打扰一下","explanation":"실례：失礼、打扰；-지만 表示“虽然……但”，实为礼貌地开始提问。","readings":[{"term":"실례","audio":"/audio/a093e7a78337b547c773.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26872","senseId":"1","lemma":"실례","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실례지만","audio":"/audio/3efe88baa668f1b42f8b.mp3"}},{"text":"혹시","meaning":"请问","explanation":"혹시：用不确定、委婉的语气提问；这里相当于“请问”。","readings":[{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87955","senseId":"4","lemma":"혹시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"시입니까?","meaning":"是几点","explanation":"시：点钟；-입니까? 是正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시입니까","audio":"/audio/2aad26b160323e95c36d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a093e7a78337b547","term":"실례","zh":"失礼","audio":"/audio/a093e7a78337b547c773.mp3","entryId":"26872","definition":"违背礼仪；실례지만 在问路、问时间前作礼貌的“打扰一下”。","pronunciation":["실례"]},{"id":"c99406fc3132c80d","term":"혹시","zh":"请问、不知","